WEBVTT

01:46:32.542 --> 01:46:33.625
The front door is locked.

01:46:34.584 --> 01:46:36.334
-Wait, are you here?
-Yeah.

01:46:36.959 --> 01:46:38.542
What are you doing
here at this time?

01:46:38.875 --> 01:46:39.834
What happened, Dad?

01:46:39.917 --> 01:46:42.000
It's your brother's usual mess.
